# Units are enabled and started in this order by `make services-check`
# (bootstrap) and driven by services-start / services-stop / restart.
# xvfb x11vnc novnc form the headless/VNC stack; herbst targets
# localhost:0.0, which Xvfb provides on VNC setups.
xvfb x11vnc novnc herbst compton dunst hc_send-error-daemon
